{"4948670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monster Tide", "steam_appid": 4948670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use a variety of weapons. By shooting the 【Broodmother Segments】, the 【Broodmother】 will emerge. During the destruction of the world, players can collect various types of ammunition and kill the 【Monsters】 that stand in their way to earn 【Destruction Score】.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the 【Broodmother】 and achieve a higher 【Destruction Score】.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of the embodiment of 【Destruction】—the 【Destroyer】. The 【Destroyer】 was summoned solely for 【Destruction】. It is not because 【Destruction】 itself holds any value, but because once the 【Destroyer】 is summoned, the 【Destroyer】 will inevitably carry out 【Destruction】.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action Game, Shooter</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inner Monologue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When neither 【Justice】, 【Law】, 【Ethics】, 【Morality】, 【Friends】, nor 【Reason】 stand on my side, and even my 【Perception】 has been corrupted, do I still have the 【Courage】 to act?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire world is my enemy. The 【Broodmother】, which gave birth to all existence, must be destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【I】 will destroy 【Existence】.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After betraying all of my previous efforts and choosing 【Destroy All Existence and Destroy the World】 as my goal,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【I】 have become the enemy of the entire world. My enemies cannot wait to destroy 【Me】. History dares not record my name, and there will be no gravestone for 【Me】. 【I】 will become the 【Public Enemy of All】. 【I】 regard every person, every object, every animal, and all 【Existence】 as 【Monsters】. Therefore, what 【I】 face is the 【Monster Tide】.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My ending is the result of 【My】 own choices.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use a variety of weapons. By shooting the 【Broodmother Segments】, the 【Broodmother】 will emerge. During the destruction of the world, players can collect various types of ammunition and kill the 【Monsters】 that stand in their way to earn 【Destruction Score】.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the 【Broodmother】 and achieve a higher 【Destruction Score】.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of the embodiment of 【Destruction】—the 【Destroyer】. The 【Destroyer】 was summoned solely for 【Destruction】. It is not because 【Destruction】 itself holds any value, but because once the 【Destroyer】 is summoned, the 【Destroyer】 will inevitably carry out 【Destruction】.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action Game, Shooter</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inner Monologue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When neither 【Justice】, 【Law】, 【Ethics】, 【Morality】, 【Friends】, nor 【Reason】 stand on my side, and even my 【Perception】 has been corrupted, do I still have the 【Courage】 to act?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire world is my enemy. The 【Broodmother】, which gave birth to all existence, must be destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【I】 will destroy 【Existence】.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After betraying all of my previous efforts and choosing 【Destroy All Existence and Destroy the World】 as my goal,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【I】 have become the enemy of the entire world. My enemies cannot wait to destroy 【Me】. History dares not record my name, and there will be no gravestone for 【Me】. 【I】 will become the 【Public Enemy of All】. 【I】 regard every person, every object, every animal, and all 【Existence】 as 【Monsters】. Therefore, what 【I】 face is the 【Monster Tide】.</p>